* CVSD decoder A — breadboard baseline
* Same engine as enc_a without the LM311: BIT and CLK from outside.
* mf8-spec.md §12.1, circuit-review.md §2.4 / §4, falstad CVSD-DEC
*
* Pins: BIT CLK Y SYL VDD VCC VEE

.subckt cvsd_dec_a BIT CLK Y SYL VDD VCC VEE

* Run register — first flop samples external BIT
Xd0 BIT CLK Q  NQ  HC74_DFF
Xd1 Q   CLK Q1 NQ1 HC74_DFF
Xd2 Q1  CLK Q2 NQ2 HC74_DFF
Rnq1 NQ1 0 1Meg
Rnq2 NQ2 0 1Meg

* Coincidence: /COIN = (Q⊕Q1)∨(Q1⊕Q2)
Aadc [Q Q1 Q2] [qd q1d q2d] hc_adc
Ax01 [qd q1d] x01d hc_xor
Ax12 [q1d q2d] x12d hc_xor
Aor  [x01d x12d] ncd hc_or
Adac [ncd] [NCOIN] hc_dac

R1 NCOIN SYL 51.1k
R2 SYL 0 2.55Meg
Csyl SYL 0 100n

* Iabc: ½ TL072 + 2N3906
Rvref VDD VA 100
Cvref VA 0 100u
Xoa SYL VA_EMIT VCC VEE BASE TL072
Qp IABC BASE VA_EMIT Q2N3906
Rset VA VA_EMIT 30.9k

* LM13700 half: ±224 mV from Q / NQ
Rd1 Q   INP 47k
Rd2 INP 0   2.2k
Rd3 NQ  INN 47k
Rd4 INN 0   2.2k
Rlin LIN 0 100Meg
Rbin BIN 0 100Meg
Rbuf BUF 0 100Meg
Xota LIN INP INN IABC INT VCC VEE BIN BUF HALF13700

Cint INT 0 10n
Rint INT 0 100k
Xfoll INT Y VCC VEE Y TL072

.ends cvsd_dec_a
